>>> 3177: void FlexLine::ResolveFlexibleLengths(nscoord aFlexContainerMainSize,
    3178:                                       ComputedFlexLineInfo* aLineInfo) {
    3179:   // In this function, we use 64-bit coord type to avoid integer overflow in
    3180:   // case several of the individual items have huge hypothetical main sizes,
    3181:   // which can happen with percent-width table-layout:fixed descendants. Here we
    3182:   // promote the container's main size to 64-bit to make the arithmetic
    3183:   // convenient.
