    3187:   // out, we inform it of each item's base size, and we initialize the "delta"
    3188:   // for each item to 0. (And if the flex algorithm wants to grow or shrink the
    3189:   // item, we'll update this delta further down.)
    3190:   if (aLineInfo) {
